<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia central bank seen selling dlr forward.</title>
<headline>Indonesia central bank seen selling dlr forward.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's central bank, Bank Indonesia, was seen selling six-month dollar forward at 2,745 in the market, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;We heard the central bank was selling six-month forward at the 2,745 level,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>Spot rupiah was quoted at 2,625 at 0620 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
